  "change_id": "M670-20261112-ISSUE602-PR603-INDEPENDENT-UI-SMS-TRANSFER - M671-ISSUE605-TOUR-RETIREMENT-AND-TAP-DISMISS",
  "human_scope_review": "Owner requested eight UI/SMS/transfer dashboard corrections in a separate PR from #601 on 2026-11-12; Issue #602 and docs/WAFFRA_REQUIREMENTS.md recorded before code. Exactly these bounded sections and original regression assertions were reviewed; no SQLCipher writer or SMS account inference changes. This manifest is scope declaration only, not device sign-off; preserve all original quality gates.",
  "user_requested_changes": [
    "Remove X from all Snackbars and display long feedback without truncation while retaining Undo and accessible styling.",
    "Show Notifications pull-to-refresh bank-message scan feedback inside Notifications, including concise no-new-messages wording.",
    "Open verified transfer form when one account exists, supporting second-account creation while requiring distinct owned accounts.",
    "Shorten alternative bank SMS manual income/expense decision and route straight to the selected entry template.",
    "Make savings goal and recurring-count cards follow the categories main/subcategory stat visual and count style.",
    "Match goals wallet hero card width and height to the Home balance hero on the same screen.",
    "Reduce recurring reminder switch card height to match adjacent recurring controls.",
    "Apply Show more and Show less to all Home activity filters using true filtered event counts.",
    "Keep notifications SMS rescan regression aligned with the new screen-local feedback callback while preserving the guarded incremental scan behavior.",
    "M671 Issue #605: Retire the entire onboarding/replay seven-step tour and its persisted startup trigger, overlay and My Settings entry, including exact tour-only source asset; preserve normal splash and About/settings behavior.",
    "M671 Issue #605: Tap anywhere once to dismiss a visible Snackbar immediately without losing the tapped widget action, an Undo callback, or passive notice expiry; do not treat scrolling as a tap.",
    "M671: Update obsolete M274 Snackbar-close UX test and M282 accessible action-size proof to the owner-approved X-free notice and nonblocking global tap-to-dismiss, keeping footer navigation and minimum 48dp action checks active.",
    "M671 reconcile the old two test source markers for the MaterialApp builder: WaffraNoticeTapDismissArea is an outer nonblocking wrapper, while WaffraIdleBiometricOverlay remains the existing inner lifecycle gate with all original background and privacy assertions unchanged.",
    "M670/M671 exact-head CI fixes: preserve behavior while migrating M461/M548/M638/M647 positive SMS scan and rule-learning regression method anchors to `_rescanAutoSmsInbox({BuildContext? feedbackContext})`; repair immediate edge notice layout so it never mutates RenderAnimatedSize during a frame; update M206 root listener and M670 message-specific clipping expectation while preserving existing financial checks."
  ],
